.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH export 1  "export " 
.SH NAME
export \- Export binary snapshot file (.imps) back to CSV/TSV edge lists
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBexport\fR <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\-dir\fR> [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISNAPSHOT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export binary snapshot file (.imps) back to CSV/TSV edge lists
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\-dir\fR \fI<OUTDIR>\fR
Output directory for exported edge files
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: tsv]
Export format (tsv, csv, jsonl)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISNAPSHOT\fR>
Input binary snapshot file (.imps)
